  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "spatial-iq",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Description:\n\t\n\nA dataset containing scenes of stacks of objects on tabletop or warehouse floor generated using Isaac Sim, stored into the form images. We are licensing this dataset permissively, including for commercial use. This dataset does not contain any personal or confidential data.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Owner(s):\n\t\n\nNVIDIA Corporation\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Creation Date:\n\t\n\nApril 10th, 2026\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tLicense/Terms of Use:\n\t\n\nGoverning Terms: This dataset is governed\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/patrickqrim/spatial-iq.",
